Parse a dimensionality string like "[length] / [time]" into a dict.

Examples:
    "[length]" -> {"[length]": 1}
    "[length] / [time]" -> {"[length]": 1, "[time]": -1}
    "[length] ** 2 / [time]" -> {"[length]": 2, "[time]": -1}
    "[mass] / [length] ** 3" -> {"[mass]": 1, "[length]": -3}

Returns:
